# Cargo.lock is intentionally tracked for all workspaces so tagged release builds are
# reproducible (CI builds from pinned dependency versions, not whatever resolves that day).

# ─── Developer planning notes — NOT for the public repo ──────────
# These are internal working documents (e.g. the macOS build/rent plan and its provisioning
# scripts). They live in the private engine project; keep them out of the public suite repo.
docs/mac/
**/docs/mac/
*.plan.md
PLAN-*.md
*-PLAN.md

# ─── Local build / capture material — NOT for the public repo ────
# Verified release copies, run logs, UI captures, and local-only helper scripts. These are
# produced during local builds and verification and are intentionally untracked (see CONTEXT.md).
dist-exe/
dist-win/
shots/
shots-*/
shots[0-9]*/
rwk-app/dist-local/
**/_check*
**/_about_test*
_test_esp_ui.ps1
